# Simulink build and cache artefacts
slprj/
*.slxc
*.autosave
*.asv
# The model is generated by build_model.m, so it is not tracked
autox_lateral.slx
# Octave/MATLAB session leftovers
octave-workspace

# Full simulation logs: 1.7 MB of binary, regenerated by run_all in a minute.
# The small sweep results are kept, since they save a long grid search in Octave
# and results_tuning_3cond.mat is cited in the report.
results.mat

# Sweep outputs that run_all rewrites. Only results_tuning.mat is tracked: the
# code loads it for the tuned gains, and regenerating it is a 380-simulation
# grid search.
results_width.mat
results_gain_latency.mat
results_lookahead.mat
results_tuning_3cond.mat

# Generated outputs: run_all.m rewrites both on every run, so they are build
# artefacts rather than sources.
report/kpi_tables.md
figures/
